Urinary albumin excretion can be estimated in a spot urine sample using several tests (from most preferred to least preferred):

- · urine albumin-to-creatinine ratio (ACR)
- · urine protein-to-creatinine ratio (PCR)
- · reagent strip ('dipstick') urine analysis for albumin or total protein with automated reading
- · reagent strip ('dipstick') urine analysis for albumin or total protein with manual reading.

